    {
      "id": "MQvcHeBL3srA9HAkMCh_c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2153.107134166192,
      "y": -457.88958002577635,
      "width": 360.47991943359375,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337724299,
      "version": 800,
      "versionNonce": 220175723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789715687337,
      "created": 1789712486911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "创建规则：与部署模式有关\nTP: 张量并行\nPP: 流水线并行\nDP: 数据并行\nEP: 专家并行\nGpuWorkRunner主要负责当前GPU的模型执行。\n比如TP是分片的，那当前gpu的runner 只加载对\n应的分片权重，当执行forward时，只负责forward\n自己对应的cuda计算。\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "创建规则：与部署模式有关\nTP: 张量并行\nPP: 流水线并行\nDP: 数据并行\nEP: 专家并行\nGpuWorkRunner主要负责当前GPU的模型执行。\n比如TP是分片的，那当前gpu的runner 只加载对\n应的分片权重，当执行forward时，只负责forward\n自己对应的cuda计算。\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
